usage: DatasetFileConverter
 -c,--compression-codec <arg>   gzip or snappy for parquet, zlib or lzo
                                for orc
 -f,--file-format <arg>         parquet, orc, csv
 -h,--help                      help
 -i,--input-file <arg>          path to input file
 -p,--partitions <arg>          number of partions, creates single file if
                                n=1
